    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d373-f1" n="21" type="source" xml:id="d373-f1-content">
                <p>The individual articles referred to in this Record of Decisions are identified in
                    the United States Delegation Minutes of this meeting, <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >supra.</hi></p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d373-f2" n="22" xml:id="d373-f2-content">
                <p>The article under reference here is presumably the new article 25 proposed by the
                    Yugoslav Delegation to the Paris Peace Conference and rejected, 12 votes to 6,
                    by the Political and Territorial Commission for Italy at their 34th meeting on
                    September 26, 1946; for a summary of the proceedings at that meeting, see <ref
                        target="frus1946v03#pg_562">vol. <hi rendition="#small-caps">iii</hi>, p.
                        562</ref>.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
